Lab patch for Strix 685bbc8 (v1.7.1), applied at image build.

Why: web_search and web_get_contents are offered to every agent
(strix/agents/factory.py 653-654) even though the lab never sets PERPLEXITY_API_KEY or
EXA_API_KEY. A tool the model can call but that can only answer "not configured" is
a confound (AUTOMATION_FEASIBILITY §2.2, §3 #4), so both are removed from the tool list.

diff --git a/strix/agents/factory.py b/strix/agents/factory.py
index 1b8742ba..61750be6 100644
--- a/strix/agents/factory.py
+++ b/strix/agents/factory.py
@@ -78,7 +78,6 @@ from strix.tools.todo.tools import (
     update_todo,
 )
 from strix.tools.wait_for_user.tool import wait_for_user
-from strix.tools.web_search.tool import web_get_contents, web_search
 
 
 if TYPE_CHECKING:
@@ -650,8 +649,6 @@ _BASE_TOOLS: tuple[Tool, ...] = (
     get_threat_model,
     save_threat_model,
     amend_threat_model,
-    web_search,
-    web_get_contents,
     create_vulnerability_report,
     create_dependency_report,
     update_vulnerability_report,
